<body>

<div class="blob b1"></div>
<div class="blob b2"></div>
<div class="blob b3"></div>

<div class="card">

<h1>🌸 Things That Make You... You 🌸</h1>

<p style="font-size:16px;color:#666;">
A few completely honest observations... 😂👇
</p>

<div style="background:#ffe4ec;padding:15px;border-radius:18px;margin:12px 0;text-align:left;">
<h3>💛 1. Caring</h3>
<p>
You act like you don't care... but deep down you actually do. Whether you admit it or not, you always notice the little things. 🌼✨
</p>
</div>

<div style="background:#fff3c4;padding:15px;border-radius:18px;margin:12px 0;text-align:left;">
<h3>🧸 2. Cutie</h3>
<p>
Don't even try to argue... 😤<br><br>
Your random expressions, reactions, and innocent face sometimes are just too cute. 😂🌸
</p>
</div>

<div style="background:#d8f3ff;padding:15px;border-radius:18px;margin:12px 0;text-align:left;">
<h3>😎 3. Attitude Wali</h3>
<p>
That attitude... 😂<br><br>
Sometimes it's sky high, sometimes it's zero... but somehow it suits you perfectly. Never lose that confidence. ✨
</p>
</div>

<div style="background:#ffe8b6;padding:15px;border-radius:18px;margin:12px 0;text-align:left;">
<h3>😂 4. Ishan Paglu</h3>
<p>
Okay okay... one thing is very clear... 🤭<br><br>

Whenever the name <b>Ishan</b> appears...
someone suddenly becomes extra interested. 👀😂

I'm not saying anything else...
The evidence speaks for itself. 😭🌸
</p>
</div>

<div style="background:#daf8d8;padding:15px;border-radius:18px;margin:12px 0;text-align:left;">
<h3>🚀 5. Encouraging</h3>
<p>
You may not even realize it, but your words can cheer people up. Keep being that person. 🌸💛
</p>
</div>

<div style="background:#eadcff;padding:15px;border-radius:18px;margin:12px 0;text-align:center;">
<h2>😴 6. De-Modi-Vated 😂</h2>

<p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;color:#6a1b9a;">
DE ➜ MODI ➜ VATED
</p>

<p>
No explanation required. 🤣🌸
</p>

</div>

<button onclick="location.href='memories.html'">
🎁 One More Surprise →
</button>

</div>

<script>

let emoji=["🌸","🌼","✨","💛","🦋","🌺","🌷"];

for(let i=0;i<50;i++){

let e=document.createElement("div");

e.className="flower";

e.innerHTML=emoji[Math.floor(Math.random()*emoji.length)];

e.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

e.style.fontSize=(20+Math.random()*18)+"px";

e.style.animationDuration=(5+Math.random()*6)+"s";

document.body.appendChild(e);

}

</script>

</body>